  "bodyHash": "6c0e06674e48c6d0",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是否曾想过融入当地村民？借助 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Village Masquerade</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，你可以换上与村民如出一辙的装扮漫步其中。从农夫沾满尘土的帽子到图书管理员精致的托加袍，每种职业都有独特的风格。这些服装或许无法抵挡箭矢，但能为你赢得村民的好感，并在交易桌前获得更优惠的价格。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每件装备在与对应职业的村民交易时都能提供小幅折扣，穿戴的部件越多，效果越强。大多数服装可以通过与大师级村民交易获得。部分套装较为稀有，由灾厄村民或铁傀儡掉落，而另一些则藏在村庄宝箱中。无论你是为了收集、角色扮演，还是单纯想讨好你最喜欢的图书管理员，这个模组都会让每次进城之旅增添几分乐趣。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">村民服饰：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上灵感源自各村民职业的服装。每件装备都能在与对应村民交易时提供折扣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">盔甲匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上护目镜和围裙，化身真正的金属工匠。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🥩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">屠夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">系上坚固的头带和围裙，投身肉类贸易。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🗺️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制图师：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">佩戴闪亮的单片眼镜和皮质背带，尽显干练。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✝️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牧师：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">身着高领与精致长袍，契合神圣的酿造仪式。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌾 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">农夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">宽檐帽遮阳蔽日，腰带随身工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎣 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">渔夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上帽子、马甲和长裤，随时准备出海捕鱼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">箭术师：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">头戴羽毛帽，系上轻便腰带，与箭矢完美搭配。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👞 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">皮革工：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上粗犷的围裙，用于鞣制和加工皮革。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">图书管理员：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">披上柔软的托加袍，戴上整洁的头饰，静心研读。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">石匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">系上沾满石粉的围裙，保持整洁利落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">笨蛋村民：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿着长袍和长裤，展现慵懒随性的魅力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐑 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牧羊人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上羊毛帽和马夹，抵御寒冷。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚒️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">工具匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">套上工作围裙，随时准备迎接熔炉的考验。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">武器匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">佩戴眼罩和围裙，彰显专业与威严。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕰️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">经典村民：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在村庄战利品箱中寻找复古风格的长袍与长裤。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">流浪商人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过交易获取明亮的兜帽、长袍和长裤。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灾厄村民套装：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由掠夺者、劫掠兽、唤魔者和女巫掉落。穿戴完整套装可伪装成他们的一员。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">女巫套装：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保护你免受有害药水效果的影响。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铁傀儡套装：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">稀有掉落物，提供击退抵抗与力量加成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎅 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神秘圣诞老人套装：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">节日季专属的欢快装扮。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端与服务器端均需安装此模组</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（适用于 Fabric 与 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模组支持配置，可直接在游戏内使用模组菜单进行修改（Fabric 平台需安装由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 开发的 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置文件类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特别感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/enderpreston/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">EnderPreston</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 制作的原版模组 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-employment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Village Employment</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，其资源素材在本作中得以复用。本模组已针对现代 Minecraft 进行了全面优化与焕新。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hang-glider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hangglider/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vehicle-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armored-foes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arcane-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
